usage: pipeline <plan|list|status|run|adopt> <fast|full|builds|all|node…>
       pipeline pin [--check-only]
       pipeline tw <in> <out> [--minify] [--cwd DIR]
       pipeline oracle-css
       pipeline product-css
       pipeline docs-catalog
       pipeline ir-diff <git-ref>|<dirA> <dirB> [--json]
       pipeline css-direction --update
       pipeline ledger --record|--render|--dissolve
       pipeline audit-boundary [--strict|discover]
       pipeline upstream --to=shadcn@X.Y.Z [--fetch] [--no-build]
       pipeline build-js
       pipeline resolve-skins [--fixtures]
       pipeline inputs <node> [--produces]

The gates are Go tests: go test -C pipeline -count=1 -v [-run '^TestPack$']
